OL,3,GNEWSARiver dolphin in 'critical'
OL,4,Arecovery period
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been urged not to interact
OL,7,Fwith a dolphin as it goes through a
OL,8,F"critical period" of recovery after its
OL,9,Frelease from netting in a river.
OL,11,FThe animal was spotted in the River
OL,12,FOrwell, near Ipswich, with green
OL,13,Fnetting clamped around its beak and
OL,14,Fpectoral fins on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,16,FThe British Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,17,F(BDMLR) said its volunteers would
OL,18,Fcontinue to monitor the dolphin and
OL,19,Fbelieved it "has every chance to exit
OL,20,Fthe river by itself".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
